From e4c133368dfc523377077093783304b42ac18e4a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Thu, 25 Jun 2026 09:37:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD terminal visual selections so panes support Vim-style
 yanks

Terminal command mode now supports character, line, and block visual selections over the focused pane. Yanking a selection copies the exact pane text through OSC52 and returns a copy action so harnesses and adapters can keep clipboard state in sync.
